<title>CHINA: Manhanttan Card interim net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Manhanttan Card interim net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr (H.K. cents)	 14.40    vs 14.29</p>
<p>     Dividend (H.K. cents)  5.80     vs 5.75</p>
<p>     Excceptional itmes     nil	vs nil</p>
<p>     Net			  215.3    vs 213.5</p>
<p>     Interest Income	  447.2    vs 416.3</p>
<p>     Company name	     Manhattan Card Co. Ltd</p>
<p>     Books close		Oct 13-17</p>
<p>     Dividend payable	 Oct 30</p>
<p>NOTE - The company holds the Hong Kong credit card operations of Chase  Manhattan Corp's Chase Manhattan Bank NA.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
